# oracle: examples/bpm/peri/in.bpm.peri.pmb cut down to a small cylinder (radius 0.002, LAMMPS b332f28, GPL-2.0 example
# input, reduced size): bond_style bpm/peri pmb with the pair_style bpm/peri contact, fix property/atom d_vfrac d_damage,
# the top layer displaced downwards by 2e-5 m (a 4 percent strain of the bonds that cross it) after a setup run, so that
# the bonds break (the example's indenter and the stiffness 1.6863e22 are not used: they are unstable at this timestep)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units si
newton on off
dimension 3
boundary f f f
atom_style bond
atom_modify map array
special_bonds lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 0.0 1.0 1.0
neighbor 0.0010 bin
comm_modify cutoff 0.0030
lattice sc 0.0005
region box block -0.003 0.003 -0.003 0.002 -0.003 0.003 units box
region target cylinder y 0.0 0.0 0.0020 -0.0020 0.0 units box
create_box 1 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 130 extra/special/per/atom 150
create_atoms 1 region target
mass * 2.75e-7
fix vol all property/atom d_vfrac d_damage ghost yes
set group all d_vfrac 1.25e-10
pair_style bpm/peri
pair_coeff * * 1.6863e13 0.0015001
create_bonds many all all 1 0.0 0.0015001
special_bonds lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 1.0 1.0 1.0
bond_style bpm/peri
bond_coeff 1 pmb 1.6863e13 0.0015001 0.0005 0.25
velocity all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 sum no units box
fix 1 all nve
region top block -0.003 0.003 -0.0004 0.002 -0.003 0.003 units box
group top region top
compute dmg all property/atom d_damage
compute davg all reduce ave c_dmg
compute nb all nbond/atom
compute tb all reduce sum c_nb
timestep 1.0e-9
thermo 20
thermo_style custom step atoms pe ebond c_davg c_tb
thermo_modify format float %.15g norm no
thermo_modify lost ignore
thermo_modify lost/bond ignore
run 0
displace_atoms top move 0.0 -2.0e-5 0.0 units box
run 200
